  "reason": "The abstract discusses the use of human induced pluripotent stem cells (hiPSCs) for modelling neurodegenerative diseases and compares 2D and 3D culture systems. However, it does not report any quantitative measure of agreement between non-human animal results and human clinical results, nor does it compare effect sizes. The focus is on the potential of hiPSC models and the comparison of in vitro culture systems, not on the concordance between animal models and human outcomes."
